avoid, which is kind of like

00:04:06.052 --> 00:04:07.350
something like something you're
doing, you're avoiding it.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.930
But, you're not really eating anything,

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.331
you're just not eating something.

00:04:10.331 --> 00:04:12.911
That would be the carbs, and
I'm talking about the sugar,

00:04:12.911 --> 00:04:16.942
refined carbohydrates, and refined grains.

00:04:16.942 --> 00:04:19.113
Let's just talk about that.

00:04:19.113 --> 00:04:23.762
Like the hidden things like
juice or flavored yogurt,

00:04:23.762 --> 00:04:25.869
that would be hidden, or alcohol.

00:04:25.869 --> 00:04:27.786
Those are hidden carbs.

00:04:29.034 --> 00:04:31.892
The philosophy of everything in moderation

00:04:31.892 --> 00:04:33.571
or portion control

00:04:33.571 --> 00:04:36.606
doesn't play into this
because all it takes

00:04:36.606 --> 00:04:39.724
